  "body": "Entrance from Milenio Crescent, Mairangi Bay.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in the prime Mairangi Bay/Rosedale area, this freehold, architecturally designed townhouse offers: \r\n- 3 bedrooms + study\r\n- 3 bathrooms (incl. master ensuite)\r\n- Internal access garage\r\n- Spacious floor area 154+9m² (incl. balcony)\r\n- Modern designer kitchen\r\n\r\nLocated within highly sought-after school zones:\r\n- Rangitoto College\r\n- Westlake Girls High School\r\n- Murrays Bay Intermediate\r\n- Mairangi Bay School\r\n- Minutes to Mairangi Bay Beach, close to Albany and motorway access.\r\n\r\nMilenio – a new master-planned community in Mairangi Bay/Rosedale, North Shore. This is a rare opportunity to purchase directly from the developer, buy with confidence and secure your home at an unbeatable price. \r\n\r\nFuture stages will integrate residential living with The Milenio Business Park, bringing retail, cafés, hospitality and office space right to your doorstep.\r\n\r\nEnquire now — we have more options from 3 to 4 bedroom new homes.",
